{"id":"8ff60c13bb604c68","group":"73","path":"73/73-df-paired-acceptance-language.md","title":"Universal Turing-Machine Acceptance Language","display":"df-universal-acceptance-language — Universal Turing-Machine Acceptance Language","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Automata Theory, Languages and Computation (Hopcroft, Ullman)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-df-paired-acceptance-language","aliases":["73-df-paired-acceptance-language","73-df-universal-acceptance-language"],"display":"df-universal-acceptance-language — Universal Turing-Machine Acceptance Language","depends_on":["[[73-df-binary-program-coding]]","[[73-df-dtm-language-semantics]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Automata Theory, Languages and Computation (Hopcroft, Ullman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-df-paired-acceptance-language"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-df-paired-acceptance-language</span><span>73-df-universal-acceptance-language</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-universal-acceptance-language — Universal Turing-Machine Acceptance Language"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"db96cabedd089e5f\" href=\"?note=db96cabedd089e5f\" title=\"73-df-binary-program-coding\">73-df-binary-program-coding</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"888d8ab66ec7efca\" href=\"?note=888d8ab66ec7efca\" title=\"73-df-dtm-language-semantics\">73-df-dtm-language-semantics</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal E\">\\(\\mathcal E\\)</span> with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{MachineCoding}(\\mathcal E)\">\\(\\operatorname{MachineCoding}(\\mathcal E)\\)</span> (fixed coding package, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"db96cabedd089e5f\" href=\"?note=db96cabedd089e5f\" title=\"73-df-binary-program-coding\">73-df-binary-program-coding</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Accept}_M(w)\">\\(\\operatorname{Accept}_M(w)\\)</span> (machine acceptance, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"888d8ab66ec7efca\" href=\"?note=888d8ab66ec7efca\" title=\"73-df-dtm-language-semantics\">73-df-dtm-language-semantics</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle\\cdot,\\cdot\\rangle_{\\mathcal E}\">\\(\\langle\\cdot,\\cdot\\rangle_{\\mathcal E}\\)</span> (binary pairing code)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}universal\\text{-}acceptance\\text{-}language}\\vdash\nA_{\\mathsf{TM},\\mathcal E}\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle\\ulcorner M\\urcorner_{\\mathcal E},w\\rangle_{\\mathcal E}:\nM\\in\\mathcal D_{\\mathsf{TM}}\\land w\\in\\mathbf 2^*\n\\land\\operatorname{Accept}_M(w)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}universal\\text{-}acceptance\\text{-}language}\\vdash\nA_{\\mathsf{TM},\\mathcal E}\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle\\ulcorner M\\urcorner_{\\mathcal E},w\\rangle_{\\mathcal E}:\nM\\in\\mathcal D_{\\mathsf{TM}}\\land w\\in\\mathbf 2^*\n\\land\\operatorname{Accept}_M(w)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The accepted object is a binary pairing of a valid machine code and an input word; the former ambiguous phrase “<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M(w)\">\\(M(w)\\)</span> Accept” has been replaced by the defined acceptance predicate.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-binary-program-coding","status":"resolved","id":"db96cabedd089e5f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-binary-program-coding]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-dtm-language-semantics","status":"resolved","id":"888d8ab66ec7efca","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-dtm-language-semantics]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-binary-program-coding","status":"resolved","id":"db96cabedd089e5f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal E$ with $\\operatorname{MachineCoding}(\\mathcal E)$ (fixed coding package, see [[73-df-binary-program-coding]])","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-dtm-language-semantics","status":"resolved","id":"888d8ab66ec7efca","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Accept}_M(w)$ (machine acceptance, see [[73-df-dtm-language-semantics]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal E","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{MachineCoding}(\\mathcal E)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Accept}_M(w)","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle\\cdot,\\cdot\\rangle_{\\mathcal E}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}universal\\text{-}acceptance\\text{-}language}\\vdash\nA_{\\mathsf{TM},\\mathcal E}\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle\\ulcorner M\\urcorner_{\\mathcal E},w\\rangle_{\\mathcal E}:\nM\\in\\mathcal D_{\\mathsf{TM}}\\land w\\in\\mathbf 2^*\n\\land\\operatorname{Accept}_M(w)\\}","display":true},{"tex":"M(w)","display":false}],"bytes":1267,"backlinks":[{"id":"1d543e6e6f293638","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"749da0bcf0da6c50","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"fd777d11b311e27a","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$A_{\\mathsf{TM},\\mathcal E}$ (universal acceptance language, see [[73-df-paired-acceptance-language]])"}],"outgoing":["db96cabedd089e5